# 二进制文件：不做文本 diff / 合并，避免被当成文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
*.msi binary
*.zip binary
# The detached Ed25519 signature is 64 raw bytes. Without this, core.autocrlf
# (on here) rewrites any 0x0D 0x0A inside it to 0x0A roughly 78% of the time -
# a random 64-byte blob contains no NUL often enough to be classified as text -
# and the committed/pushed signature is then 63 bytes, which every client
# rejects with "expected 64 bytes". The mirror copies and fresh clones all get
# that broken blob, so the release would be silently uninstallable.
update.json.sig binary
*.sig binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary

